{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<section class="rfq-band">
  <div class="container rfq-band-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">RFQ / DRAWING / SAMPLE</span>
      <h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Submit a technical RFQ for industrial machine knives{% else %}提交工业机械刀具技术询价{% endif %}</h2>
    </div>
    <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Drawings, old-blade photographs, physical samples or machine and operating information can be submitted for manufacturing review.{% else %}可提交图纸、旧刀照片、实物样品或设备与工况资料，用于制造评估。{% endif %}</p>
    <a class="button button-accent" href="{{ prefix }}/rfq/">{% if lang == "en" %}View RFQ requirements{% else %}查看询价资料要求{% endif %}</a>
  </div>
</section>
